, 5180], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 281, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 250, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 121, "type": "VAEDecodeAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}, "order": 36}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [337, 343, 353], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [356.5149841308594, 734.1759643554688], "pos": [-935.5227661132812, 5748.73828125], "widgets_values": ["73a052a51a4a7e1d7dc7fc88e2fd132e71709876fa557b9320a30069754f3651.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 191, "type": "LoadImage", "title": " GridImage input", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [318, 320], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["将输入的六宫格写真画面按照顺序：左上 → 右上 → 左中 → 右中 → 左下 → 右下，生成一段连贯的真人时尚运动写真视频。\n\n保持同一位女性模特、同一套白色运动服、同一白色极简摄影棚环境，不改变人物五官、发型、身材比例和服装细节。\n\n视频开始于第一格画面，镜头缓慢推进，模特保持低姿蹲伏姿势，随后伴随音乐节奏自然起身、转身、调整身体重心，动作流畅衔接到第二格坐姿。镜头跟随人物移动，使用柔和环绕运镜。\n\n从第二格到第三格，模特轻微调整坐姿，手臂抬起整理头发，身体自然旋转，镜头从正面平滑移动到侧前方，完成姿态变化。\n\n从第三格到第四格，模特继续完成优雅的身体转动，腿部姿势自然变化，手部动作延续，镜头缓慢横移并轻微拉远，展示完整身体线条。\n\n从第四格到第五格，模特顺势躺下，动作像连续舞蹈一样自然展开，腿部抬起，鞋子进入画面，镜头低角度跟随移动，形成运动感转场。\n\n从第五格到第六格，模特保持地面动作，身体舒展伸展，腿部缓慢变化，镜头横向滑动并逐渐拉远，最终形成最后一张躺姿构图。\n\n整体视频像高级运动品牌广告大片，动作连贯无跳切，人物姿态变化自然真实，身体重心变化符合人体运动规律。\n\n摄影风格：极简白色摄影棚、高级时尚杂志感、柔和漫射光、干净背景。\n\n运镜：slow dolly in、smooth tracking shot、orbit camera、side tracking、gentle zoom out、cinematic camera movement。\n\n动作：natural posing transition、graceful body movement、fashion pose flow、slow motion movement。\n\n画质：8K cinematic quality, realistic skin texture, natural motion blur, premium fashion commercial style."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Manual prompts", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [390.3923645019531, 604.49755859375], "pos": [-1456.634521484375, 5986.017578125], "id": 138, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 4, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [346], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 194], "pos": [-572.18505859375, 4622.07421875], "widgets_values": [0.2, 0.15, 0.95, false], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 347, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "reuse_threshold"}, "name": "reuse_threshold", "label": "reuse_threshold", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "reuse_threshold"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_percent"}, "name": "start_percent", "label": "start_percent", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "start_percent"}, {"widget": {"name": "end_percent"}, "name": "end_percent", "label": "end_percent", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "end_percent"}, {"widget": {"name": "verbose"}, "name": "verbose", "label": "verbose", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "verbose"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 198, "type": "EasyCache", "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EasyCache"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [270, 114], "pos": [-280.56915283203125, 